THIRD-PARTY DATA SOURCES

The detection model was trained on public corpora. Each source retains its
own license and terms. Datasets are used for model training only; none are
redistributed inside this repository.

  SMS Spam Collection (UCI)
    Source: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/228/sms+spam+collection
    Terms: free for research use with attribution.

  SpamAssassin Public Corpus
    Source: https://spamassassin.apache.org/old/publiccorpus/
    Terms: provided for research by the Apache SpamAssassin project.

  Enron spam corpus (SetFit/enron_spam on Hugging Face)
    Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SetFit/enron_spam
    Terms: Enron corpus is public record; redistribution per HF dataset card.

  Phishing Email Dataset (ealvaradob/phishing-dataset)
    Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ealvaradob/phishing-dataset
    License: Apache-2.0.

  SMS Spam Multilingual Collection (dbarbedillo)
    Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dbarbedillo/SMS_Spam_Multilingual_Collection_Dataset
    License: GPL-3.0 (data only; used for training, not redistributed).

  Seven Phishing/Spam Email Datasets (puyang2025)
    Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/puyang2025/seven-phishing-email-datasets
    Terms: aggregated corpus; see upstream sources (TREC-05/06/07, CEAS-08,
    Enron, Ling, SpamAssassin) for original terms.

  PhishingEmailDetectionv2.0 (cybersectony)
    Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/cybersectony/PhishingEmailDetectionv2.0
    Terms: public dataset; see HF card.

  OpenPhish community feed
    Source: https://openphish.com/
    Terms: free community feed; check current terms before commercial use.

  Majestic Million
    Source: https://majestic.com/reports/majestic-million
    Terms: free download with attribution; see majestic.com terms.

